# Project specific
# Anchored: unanchored `data/` matches any directory of that name at any depth,
# so a future `app/**/data/` package would vanish from the repo while still
# building locally. Only `backend/data/` holds runtime bytes.
/data/
/models/
.cache/
uploads/
